; ============================================================================
; nextpointtennis.com — TARGET zone for Cloudflare (Wix decommission, phase 2)
;
; This file IS the target state, not a copy of the Wix zone: the Wix-only
; records (s1/s2/sel1._domainkey, sg, en, bio, www.bio, and the _dmarc CNAME)
; are deliberately absent, and _dmarc is re-issued below as our own TXT.
; bio/www.bio confirmed unused by Tomo 2026-08-22.
;
; Import:  Cloudflare -> the zone -> DNS -> Records -> Import and Export
;          -> Import DNS records -> upload this file.
; Then:    set every record to DNS only (grey cloud).
;
; Run phase 1 (ten-fifty5.com) first and prove it. NextPoint's transactional
; mail sends from noreply@ten-fifty5.com, so its deliverability is validated
; over there, not here.
; ============================================================================

$ORIGIN nextpointtennis.com.
$TTL 3600

; --- APEX + WEB -------------------------------------------------------------
; Apex already points at Render, which is why this domain has no cert problem.
; Copied verbatim from the live zone, TTL included.
; Optional hardening after import: replace with a CNAME to
; courtflow-web.onrender.com (Cloudflare flattens it) so a Render IP change
; can't strand the apex. Not required.
@                       1800 IN A     216.24.57.1
www                     1800 IN CNAME courtflow-web.onrender.com.

; --- CROSS-BRAND: DO NOT DELETE ---------------------------------------------
; A NextPoint-branded host serving the TEN-FIFTY5 upload/ingester. Confirmed
; live 2026-08-22 returning {"ok":true,"service":"NextPoint Upload/Ingester
; v3 (S3-only)"}. It looks like a stale duplicate of courtflow-api and is not.
api                     3600 IN CNAME sport-ai-api-call.onrender.com.

; --- CLERK (login + Clerk's own outbound mail) ------------------------------
; Note the instance id differs from ten-fifty5.com — separate Clerk app.
clerk                   3600 IN CNAME frontend-api.clerk.services.
accounts                3600 IN CNAME accounts.clerk.services.
clkmail                 3600 IN CNAME mail.0jbxhs7cr2p2.clerk.services.
clk._domainkey          3600 IN CNAME dkim1.0jbxhs7cr2p2.clerk.services.
clk2._domainkey         3600 IN CNAME dkim2.0jbxhs7cr2p2.clerk.services.

; --- MAIL -------------------------------------------------------------------
@                       3600 IN MX 10 aspmx.l.google.com.

; --- TXT --------------------------------------------------------------------
; No SES DKIM here by design: this domain does not send transactional mail.
@                       3600 IN TXT "v=spf1 include:_spf.google.com ~all"
@                       3600 IN TXT "google-site-verification=b-gl3z87f0N2fkBl2IV6tzstWULGBNYcUJ0DRGjsWo8"

; Replaces the Wix-hosted _dmarc CNAME. Same policy (p=none), reports to us.
_dmarc                  3600 IN TXT "v=DMARC1; p=none; rua=mailto:info@nextpointtennis.com"
